                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "903d0e78-4f17-39be-b84b-4f1d625c6206",
                        "entry_id": "d939cff1-032c-38e5-bd8f-4fbb39dd945b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tending to arrest.",
                            "Tending to stop or slow a process."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9b40036-fec3-49d0-a577-a9246d632383",
                                "sense_id": "903d0e78-4f17-39be-b84b-4f1d625c6206",
                                "text": "Some [emotions] are Instigative, and others Arrestive."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fecac844-94ba-4f00-88f4-5382a507e97e",
                                "sense_id": "903d0e78-4f17-39be-b84b-4f1d625c6206",
                                "text": "This reactive recoiling from something clearly in our nature is itself unnatural. It is as arrestive of emotional progress as the opposite practice of uncontrolled indulgence, which is a symptom, not a cause, of emotional immaturity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad84472a-b88e-432b-8a3d-a39c3378b2a6",
                                "sense_id": "903d0e78-4f17-39be-b84b-4f1d625c6206",
                                "text": "[…] most periodontal therapy aims to prevent the initiation, progression, or recurrence of periodontal diseases. This can be termed arrestive periodontal therapy."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "541c3f09-212f-3cfb-a087-3ba6005a6a0f",
                        "entry_id": "d939cff1-032c-38e5-bd8f-4fbb39dd945b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tending to arrest.",
                            "Tending to capture people’s attention."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5e5e417-0771-41bd-b104-190653dde5a6",
                                "sense_id": "541c3f09-212f-3cfb-a087-3ba6005a6a0f",
                                "text": "As fast they pressed with laboring breath,\nClinched teeth and knitted frown,\nThe sharp, arrestive cry rang out,—\n“The color-bearer’s down!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cf60ad9-b29c-4c4d-9b59-d95a5b257bd7",
                                "sense_id": "541c3f09-212f-3cfb-a087-3ba6005a6a0f",
                                "text": "I noted a curious streak of yellow in the silvered eyebrows, as if youth clung on, so to speak, by a single hair, and underneath these arrestive eyebrows green pupils alternately glowed and smouldered."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ef48c93-6e98-4927-a5d1-c814dc14a31e",
                                "sense_id": "541c3f09-212f-3cfb-a087-3ba6005a6a0f",
                                "text": "First, the reader notices in an O. Henry story the quiet but arrestive beginning."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
